Z||000004||zeusrekning||06-19-2000||09:32 PM||||Here is a pointless story of my name. <BR> (when i was younger 14-15 ) friends mom just shut down here print shop. she mad shirts and signs. lost a lot of money making gulf war shirts. but, We got the INK and "painted" the road using our "tags" any way a lot of people got pissed . Think ink on a road does not dry well. It was alot of ink. I then decided to change my tag name.<P><BR>The rekning theing is new. I have a lot of friends who mack the "Rednecks" around here by using the word, rekon, alot. So if your wondering i'm not a readneck, most people would say I'm more of a freak b/c of baggy clothes, 3/8" hole in ear and a couple piercings. oh yeah the "ing" on the end just lets it roll out better||||reg||1
